;---------------------------------------------------
;
; measuring block informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
001,0,Basic Setting: Adjustment Position
001,1,Voltage Supply,(Terminal 15),Specifcation: 0.0...15.0 V
001,2,Voltage Low Beam,(Terminal 56b),Specifcation: 0.0...15.0 V
001,3,Vehicle Speed,,Specification: 0...300 km/h
;
002,0,Basic Setting: Adjustment Position learning
002,1,Voltage front,level sensor (G78),Specification: 0.50...4.50 V\n0.00 V = level sensor faulty\n5.00 V = wiring faulty
002,2,Voltage rear,level sensor G76),Specification: 0.50...4.50 V\n0.00 V = level sensor faulty\n5.00 V = wiring faulty
002,3,Adjustment,Status,Specification: ADP i.O.
;
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
; Coding informations
;
;---------------------------------------------------
;
;
C0,Head Light Aim Control (J431) Coding
C1,00001 - Audi A3 (8L) FWD (through MY 2000)
C2,00002 - Audi A3/S3 (8L) AWD (through MY 2000)
C3,00003 - Audi A4 (8D) FWD
C4,00004 - Audi A4/S4 (8D) AWD
C5,00005 - Audi A6 (4B) FWD
C6,00006 - Audi A6 (4B) AWD
C7,00007 - Audi A8 (4D) FWD
C8,00008 - Audi A8/S8 (4D) AWD
C9,00009 - Audi TT (8N) FWD
C10,00010 - Audi TT (8N) AWD
C11,00013 - Audi A3 (8L) FWD (from MY 2001)
C12,00014 - Audi A3/S3 (8L) AWD (from MY 2001)
C13,00015 - VW Passat (3B) FWD
C14,00016 - VW Passat (3B) AWD
